  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Academy for Women Entrepreneurs (AWE) Enabling Access to Yield Enhancing Agriculture Inputs and Extension Services.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grantee is deploying the village agent model for extension support and agriculture input distribution. Rural based village agents will have incentives to create strong farmer networks and connections to community, cooperatives, SACCOS, farmer groups. Establishing model farms to act as HUBs to promote commercialization, and offer complimentary services like market information/agribusiness training center.</narrative>
  </description>
